],[["私心覺得三重最好吃的台式拉麵，麵條硬度的客製明顯吃得出來👍🏻\n副餐炸雞塊超大一份，手工肉丸不沾醬就能吃出絞肉鮮甜味。二人點雙人餐（副餐要選肉類）一定會飽🤤大推雙人套餐，CP值值很高！！（副餐忘記拍）\n青檸綠茶的檸檬很大塊，真材實料，所以不會是檸檬風味茶；奶茶的甜很像煉乳的味道（個人體驗，未經店家確認）。飲料這兩杯都很推，只是要注意都無法調整糖度。\n環境乾淨明亮，親子友善，店員們都很有工作熱忱。\n細節題外話：這間搬家前後我都超愛他們的洗手慕斯，味道舒服不傷手😊\n覺得可以改善的是：\n1. 桌和桌之間的距離可以遠一點，因為進出有點困難😖\n2. 飲料有無糖選擇會更棒",null,[0,174]]]],[],[null,null,2931,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KUFgxTkJSSFJNVWpkMllrcDVhV2xNYVRZMFpsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x40f7c2b966eda958!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmJPX1NBRHRMUjd2Ykp5aWlMaTY0ZlE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KUFgxTkJSSFJNVWpkMllrcDVhV2xNYVRZMFpsRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KUFgxTkJSSFJNVWpkMllrcDVhV2xNYVRZMFpsRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KUFgxTkJSSFJNVWpkMllrcDVhV2xNYVRZMFpsRRILMGU1U2R6VF9FWncaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tSlBYMU5CUkhSTVVqZDJZa3A1YVdsTWFUWTBabEUSCzBlNVNkelRfRVp3IhIJAAAAAAAAAAARWKntZrnC90AqCzBlNVNkelRfRVp3\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiAuoTH8tSWAxXNjq8BHeD2M5EQoykISygO"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwiluInH8tSWAxV3d14EHfx-OloQ0pMFCAIoAA"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiAuoTH8tSWAxXNjq8BHeD2M5EQ0pMFCDIoAA"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOWloxOXlRVUo2ZWtwZloyeGxUWEk0UTE5UGMxRRAB",["0x0:0x40f7c2b966eda958",null,1777205301305568,1777205301305568,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111451487791198388320/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["陳玟廷","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocITkn-4at6dnoAN3s298ocRU1Fbfx7ttOlr7n9DIQ4bFRKYCA\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111451487791198388320?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"111451487791198388320",null,24,64,null,[1,5,1],0,["在地嚮導 · 24 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwiAuoTH8tSWAxXNjq8BHeD2M5EQpr8GCE0oAA"]]]],null,"4 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[5],null,[["CIABIhD